---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Contact"
  description="Get in touch with ANU Mountaineering Club — no login required."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Contact us</h1>
    <p>
      General questions, gear questions and trip questions all go to the
      committee inbox below &mdash; no login or membership required to reach
      us.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="reach-heading">
    <h2 id="reach-heading">Ways to reach us</h2>
    <dl class="spec-list">
      <dt>Email</dt>
      <dd>anumc.committee@anu.edu.au</dd>
      <dt>Instagram</dt>
      <dd>@anumountaineering</dd>
      <dt>Weekly meeting</dt>
      <dd>
        Tuesdays, 7pm, during semester &mdash; ANU Sport building, Room 1.12
        (same room as the gear store).
      </dd>
      <dt>In person</dt>
      <dd>Drop by the gear store during opening hours &mdash; see the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/gear/`}>gear store page</a>.</dd>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="questions-heading">
    <h2 id="questions-heading">Common questions</h2>
    <dl class="spec-list">
      <dt>Do I need to be a member to come on a trip?</dt>
      <dd>No &mdash; your first trip is open at the non-member rate. Join afterwards if you want to keep coming.</dd>
      <dt>I've never climbed or hiked before, can I still come?</dt>
      <dd>Yes &mdash; look for trips graded "Beginner" on the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/trips/`}>trips page</a>, or ask us to point you at one.</dd>
      <dt>How do I join the committee?</dt>
      <dd>Committee positions are elected at the club's AGM each year &mdash; email us to be notified when nominations open.</dd>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="official-heading">
    <h2 id="official-heading">The official club site</h2>
    <p>
      This page is a student redesign made for a coursework exercise. For the
      club's actual, current site &mdash; membership sign-up, the live gear
      store system and the real trip calendar &mdash; go to
      <a href="https://anumc.org.au/">anumc.org.au</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
